      "source_text": "既非风暴亦非无风，\r\n微风……没错，这就是平常的我。\r\n所以，请表现得跟平常一样吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60a8c29ab0dba5cae5255a7fc01bc3dce5b43535ed7971a3f496b370434468bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
